          "broader_review_uses"
        ],
        "value": {
          "material": "综述指出大多数纳入研究集中在NSCLC, RCC, Melanoma，且主要使用抗PD-1/PD-L1药物。同时提到化疗等其他抗癌治疗也可能破坏肠道屏障和菌群。"
        },
        "role": "evidence",
        "snapshot_ids": [
          "snapshot::235e35281eb4c1f2e906be10"
        ]
      },
      {
        "atom_id": "atom::e16271ee6436c84aa68cc464",
        "source_handle": "P0304",
        "field_path": [
          "review_planning_B",
          "broader_review_uses"
        ],
        "value": {
          "material": "综述详细分析了纳入研究在OS/PFS定义上的不一致性，以及FMT研究中随机化困难、样本量小、合并用药（免疫抑制剂）带来的偏倚风险。"
        },
        "role": "evidence",
        "snapshot_ids": [
          "snapshot::235e35281eb4c1f2e906be10"
        ]
      },
      {
        "atom_id": "atom::7c5de44e3cb32833abfeb875",
        "source_handle": "P0304",
        "field_path": [
          "review_planning_B",
          "broader_review_uses"
        ],
        "value": {
          "material": "建议未来研究应关注抗生素使用时机（提前vs同期）、具体抗生素种类/剂量、患者种族/饮食对菌群的影响，以及扩大FMT研究的样本量。"
        },
        "role": "evidence",
        "snapshot_ids": [
          "snapshot::235e35281eb4c1f2e906be10"
        ]
      },
      {
        "atom_id": "atom::6daa6bf638fc0a586c155313",
        "source_handle": "P0304",
        "field_path": [
          "review_planning_B",
          "scope_interpretation_cautions"
        ],
        "value": "FMT的积极结果主要来源于小样本、单臂或开放标签研究，且部分患者在使用FMT前已接受过强效免疫抑制治疗，因此不能简单外推为FMT对所有ICI耐药患者的普适性解决方案。",
        "role": "evidence",
        "snapshot_ids": [
          "snapshot::235e35281eb4c1f2e906be10"
        ]
      },
      {
        "atom_id": "atom::03d903e6472f77e8ddd42f80",
        "source_handle": "P0304",
        "field_path": [
          "review_planning_B",
          "scope_interpretation_cautions"
        ],
        "value": "抗生素的负面影响虽在多数研究中观察到，但存在例外（如Lalani, Balado等），这可能源于抗生素类型、给药时机或癌症类型的差异，需谨慎归因。",
        "role": "evidence",
        "snapshot_ids": [
          "snapshot::235e35281eb4c1f2e906be10"
        ]
      },
      {
        "atom_id": "atom::75b33df0d637c35db8e354cf",
        "source_handle": "P0304",
        "field_path": [
          "review_planning_B",
          "scope_interpretation_cautions"
        ],
        "value": "综述未进行Meta分析，因此提供的效应方向是定性的，缺乏统一的效应量估计。",
        "role": "evidence",
        "snapshot_ids": [
          "snapshot::235e35281eb4c1f2e906be10"
        ]
      },
      {
        "atom_id": "atom::1b51b4a793d85bd67eec15e5",
        "source_handle": "P0304",
        "field_path": [
          "review_planning_B",
          "scope_interpretation_cautions"
